{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22475","headline":"蚊蟆 · 白居易","name":"蚊蟆","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"巴徼炎毒早，二月蚊蟆生。\n咂肤拂不去，绕耳薨薨声。\n斯物颇微细，中人初甚轻。\n如有肤受谮，久则疮痏成。\n痏成无奈何，所要防其萌。\n麽虫何足道，潜喻儆人情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22475.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22475","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}